# Walk with the Ancestors: "target permanent card from your graveyard" (CR 115.1, 110.4a). Bot1's Lightning Bolt (an instant) in its own graveyard is
# not a permanent card, and Bot2's Ornithopter (a permanent card, but in Bot2's graveyard) is not in Bot1's graveyard: neither can be chosen. Black
# Lotus (a permanent card, sacrificed for its {G}{G}{G}) in Bot1's own graveyard can: it comes back, and discover 4 then finds Wrath of God (mana
# value 4, the most discover 4 allows), which Bot1 declines to cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Walk with the Ancestors
Lightning Bolt
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Forest
Forest
Wrath of God
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

